Note on third-party interfaces
------------------------------

This plugin talks to an EndNote library by reading and writing its SQLite
working copy and by handing EndNote `.enw` files to import. It does not contain
or redistribute any Clarivate code.

EndNote is a trademark of Clarivate Analytics. This project is an independent
integration and is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or supported by Clarivate.
Use it on a library you have backed up.
